      "text": "A rather small pearl that has a very nice silvery\nsheen to it. It can be sold at a low price to shops.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "きれいな　銀色に　光る\n少し　ちいさめの　真珠。\nショップで　安く　売れる。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "散发着美丽银辉\n且有点小的珍珠。\n可以在商店低价出售。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Brillante perla pequeña y plateada que no alcanza un\nbuen precio en las tiendas.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
